{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03538",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.13,
      "end_seconds": 4.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting, come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.77,
      "end_seconds": 6.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Hello, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.02,
      "end_seconds": 9.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.73,
      "end_seconds": 13.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "I've been feeling tired."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.87,
      "end_seconds": 17.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.22,
      "end_seconds": 27.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Erm, it's been about two weeks now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.18,
      "end_seconds": 31.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.25,
      "end_seconds": 45.77,
      "duration_seconds": 12.52,
      "text": "I'd give it a eight, out of ten. I mean, um, I've had tingling in my feet too, for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.63,
      "end_seconds": 57.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.87,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.48,
      "end_seconds": 76.75,
      "duration_seconds": 18.27,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day. Mostly mild. I told my wife I'd come today. Um, I've had being unsteady too, for about a week. About being unsteady, I'd call it severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.81,
      "end_seconds": 82.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.34,
      "end_seconds": 86.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.24,
      "end_seconds": 91.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.38,
      "end_seconds": 98.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, no, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.93,
      "end_seconds": 103.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.12,
      "end_seconds": 114.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Yes, I had a bunion operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.13,
      "end_seconds": 128.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.37,
      "end_seconds": 133.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.11,
      "end_seconds": 138.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.99,
      "end_seconds": 142.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.0,
      "end_seconds": 148.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.66,
      "end_seconds": 153.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.18,
      "end_seconds": 158.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Alright, are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.56,
      "end_seconds": 162.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.23,
      "end_seconds": 166.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.8,
      "end_seconds": 170.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Nothing regular, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.74,
      "end_seconds": 174.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.28,
      "end_seconds": 181.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Nope, uh, no weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.82,
      "end_seconds": 186.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Yes. Any diarrhoea, back pain or bladder problems at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.27,
      "end_seconds": 191.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Um, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.85,
      "end_seconds": 195.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.66,
      "end_seconds": 198.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.39,
      "end_seconds": 203.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.24,
      "end_seconds": 210.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Um, you know, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.94,
      "end_seconds": 227.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.12,
      "end_seconds": 243.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.07,
      "end_seconds": 261.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, heart rate 73, saturation 99 percent, blood pressure 124 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.68,
      "end_seconds": 268.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.06,
      "end_seconds": 272.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Okay, breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.66,
      "end_seconds": 291.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "The feeling in your feet is reduced and your balance with the eyes closed is poor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.92,
      "end_seconds": 297.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.24,
      "end_seconds": 338.54,
      "duration_seconds": 25.3,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. I think we're dealing with a possible gut-related cause of nerve symptoms at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let's book a coeliac blood test to look into neuropathy. I'm going to order a B12 level, for neuropathy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.41,
      "end_seconds": 341.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.14,
      "end_seconds": 352.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "Please keep eating gluten normally until the coeliac test is done. Come back after the results. So, that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.94,
      "end_seconds": 358.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.46,
      "end_seconds": 360.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}